---
source: crates/zendriver-mcp/tests/schema_snapshots.rs
expression: "schema_for! (tools::navigation::WaitFor)"
---
$schema: "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema"
title: WaitFor
description: "Wait strategy options for `browser_goto`, `browser_back`,\n`browser_forward` and `browser_reload`."
oneOf:
  - description: "Wait for the page to finish loading (its `load` event, or the end of\na navigation that has none, like a back-forward-cache restore)."
    type: string
    const: load
  - description: Wait until the network has been idle for ~500ms (5s outer timeout).
    type: string
    const: idle
  - description: Return immediately after the navigation request is dispatched.
    type: string
    const: none
